	"Description": "Tired of having boring orange tickets in your pretty pastel inventory? No longer! This is a simple mod that just makes the prize tickets cute. \n<br />\n<br />This ONLY affects the tickets in your inventory. The ticket shown on the machine and the machine ui are unaffected, since those are often affected by UI mods and I wanted to keep this simple. If anyone wants to use this ticket on their ui designs, please feel free!\n<br />\n<br />To install:\n<br />Unzip the file and place the folder \"[CP] Cute Prize Ticket\" into StardewValley/mods. Requires Content Patcher!",
